---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import CtaBlock from '../components/CtaBlock.astro';
---
<Base title="Cookie Policy | Newport Homeopathy Clinic" description="Which cookies this website uses and how to manage them." breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Cookie policy', href: '/cookie-policy/' }]}>
  <section>
    <div class="container prose">
      <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
      <h2>Strictly necessary</h2>
      <p>We store your cookie choice in your browser (key <code>nhc_consent</code>) so we don't ask again. This needs no consent.</p>
      <h2>Analytics (only if you accept)</h2>
      <p>Google Analytics 4 sets cookies named <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code> to count visits and button clicks. They are not set unless you click Accept. You can change your choice at any time with "Cookie settings" in the footer.</p>
      <h2>Third-party content</h2>
      <p>The map only loads from Google when you click "Show interactive map". The booking tool and spam protection on the booking page may set their own necessary cookies.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <CtaBlock />
</Base>
